9
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:40,560
Be patient. Can you leave? Can you leave?

10
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:43,820
That fool managed to hold on without any minor injuries.

11
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:44,980
Plans change

12
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:46,980
We can't go around anymore

13
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:48,980
We must cross the city ahead as quickly as possible

14
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,980
We need antibiotics, we need disinfectant

15
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:52,980
Everything is needed to treat wounds and prevent infection.

16
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:54,980
Our wounds may also kill us

17
00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:59,860
Just stay here. It's quite safe.

18
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:01,860
Can drones still be used?

19
00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:03,860
It's just that the shell was cracked a few times and it's a bit steep to fly.

20
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:04,860
but does not affect functionality

21
00:01:04,860 --> 00:01:06,860
Otherwise, I'd better go

22
00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:07,860
One week older than him
